Value SYSTEM_DESCRIPTION (.+)
Value SYSTEM_START_TIME (.+)
Value SYSTEM_UPTIME (.+)
Value SYSTEM_HARDWARE_VERSION (.+)
Value SYSTEM_SOFTWARE_VERSION (.+)
Value SYSTEM_BOOT_VERSION (.+)

Start
  ^System description\s+:\s+${SYSTEM_DESCRIPTION}
  ^System start time\s+:\s+${SYSTEM_START_TIME}
  ^System uptime\s+:\s+${SYSTEM_UPTIME}
  ^System hardware version\s+:\s+${SYSTEM_HARDWARE_VERSION}
  ^System software version\s+:\s+${SYSTEM_SOFTWARE_VERSION}
  ^System BOOT version\s+:\s+${SYSTEM_BOOT_VERSION} -> Record
